/*
 * Implements semantic validation for function prototypes.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of parameter declarations(types, mutability, decorators),
 *   - validation of the `self` parameter for methods,
 *   - validation of return types,
 *   - extraction of attribute locations,
 *   - construction of ProtoVarDeclValue entries for parameters,
 *   - enforcement of reference/lazy/mutability rules,
 *   - detection of invalid default values.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::proto
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/proto.yr
 * @Author(s):
